[218.607363, "o", "\u001b[2;1H\u001b[48;5;237m  \u001b[38;5;231m에이전트 타입을 각각 팀원으로 spawn 해 병렬 디버깅 하세요.\u001b[39m       \r\n\u001b[49m\u001b[38;5;246m  ⎿  Read \u001b[1mbuggy_app/calc.py\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[38;5;246m (19 lines)\u001b[39m\u001b[29X\r\n\u001b[38;5;246m  ⎿  Read \u001b[1mbuggy_app/test_calc.py\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[38;5;246m (26 lines)\u001b[39m\u001b[24X\r\n\u001b[38;5;246m  ⎿  Listed directory \u001b[1m.claude/agents/\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[30X\u001b[6;6H\u001b[38;5;246mInterrupted · What should C\u001b[Caude do instead?\u001b[39m\u001b[7;67H\u001b[1K\r\n\u001b[38;5;239m\u001b[48;5;237m❯ \u001b[38;5;231m@buggy_app/calc.py 에 버그가 있어 @buggy_app/test_calc.py 의 \u001b[39m    \r\n  \u001b[38;5;231m테스트 3개 모두 실패합니다. @.claude/agents/ 에 정의해 두 세 \u001b[39m    \r\n  \u001b[38;5;231m에이전트 타입을 각각 팀원으로 spawn 해 병렬 디버깅 하세요.\u001b[39m       \r\n  \u001b[38;5;231m만약 아래 agent 이름으로 다른 세션이 열려 있다면, 해당 세션에서 \u001b[12;3H작업하세요. \u001b[39m                                                 \u001b[13;3H                                                          \u001b[14;3H\u001b[38;5;231m- boundary-bug-hunter 에이전트 타입으로 팀원 A 를\u001b[C스폰하세요. \u001b[39m  \u001b[15;3H\u001b[38;5;231m- float-compare-bug-hunter 에이전트로 팀원 B 를 스폰하세요. \u001b[16;3H- state-share-bug-hunter 에이전트로 팀원 C 를 스폰하세요.\u001b[17;3H\u001b[39m                                                              \u001b[18;3H\u001b[38;5;231m각 팀원은 원인을 정확히 짚어내고 고친\u001b[C코드와\u001b[C이유를 보고해야 \u001b[19;3H합니다.\u001b[39m                                                  \r\n\u001b[49m\u001b[38;5;246m  ⎿  Read \u001b[1mbuggy_app/calc.py\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[38;5;246m (19 lines)\u001b[39m\u001b[29X\r\n\u001b[38;5;246m  ⎿  Read \u001b[1mbuggy_app/test_calc.py\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[38;5;246m (26 lines)\u001b[39m\u001b[24X\r\n\u001b[38;5;246m  ⎿  Listed directory \u001b[1m.claude/agents/\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[30X\u001b[23;67H\u001b[1K\r\n\u001b[38;5;231m●\u001b[39m 현재 이 세션 자체가 \u001b[38;5;153mstate-share-bug-hunter\u001b[39m(팀원\u001b[CC)이고,\r\n  \u001b[38;5;153mboundary-bug-hunter\u001b[39m와 \u001b[38;5;153mfloat-compare-bug-hunter\u001b[39m로\u001b[C이미\u001b[C열린\u001b[C세션이\u001b[26;3H있으므로\u001b[C그쪽에\u001b[C작업을\u001b[C지시하고,\u001b[C저는\u001b[C\u001b[38;5;153madd_record\u001b[39m의\u001b[C상태\u001b[C공유\r\n \u001b[C버그를 직접 분석하겠습니다.\u001b[38X\r\n\u001b[38;5;246m  ⎿  “moving_average 경계값 버그 조사 요청” → sent to \u001b[39m\u001b[13X\u001b[29;3H   \u001b[38;5;246mboundary-bug-hunter - another Claude session on this \u001b[39m\u001b[9X\u001b[30;3H   \u001b[38;5;246mmachine\u001b[39m\u001b[55X\u001b[31;7H\u001b[38;5;246mis_close_\u001b[Cnough 부동소수점\u001b[C비교\u001b[C버그 조사 요청”\u001b[C→ sent \u001b[32;6Ht\u001b[C float\u001b[Ccompare-bug-hu\u001b[Cter -\u001b[Canoth\u001b[Cr Claude\u001b[Csession\u001b[Con \u001b[33;6Hthis machine\u001b[35;32H9\u001b[40;3H\u001b(B\u001b[m"]
