[222.614404, "o", "\u001b[1;67H\u001b[1K\r\n\u001b[38;5;246m  ⎿  Read \u001b[1mbuggy_app/test_calc.py\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[38;5;246m (26 lines)\u001b[39m\u001b[24X\u001b[3;6H\u001b[38;5;246mListed directory \u001b[1m.\u001b[Claude/agents/\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[30X\u001b[4;6H\u001b[38;5;246mInterrupted · What should Claude do instead?\u001b[39m\u001b[5;67H\u001b[1K\r\n\u001b[38;5;239m\u001b[48;5;237m❯ \u001b[38;5;231m@buggy_app/calc.py 에 버그가 있어 @buggy_app/test_calc.py 의 \u001b[39m    \r\n  \u001b[38;5;231m테스트 3개 모두 실패합니다. @.claude/agents/ 에 정의해 두 세 \u001b[39m    \r\n  \u001b[38;5;231m에이전트 타입을 각각 팀원으로 spawn 해 병렬 디버깅 하세요.\u001b[39m   \u001b[9;3H\u001b[38;5;231m만약 아래 agent\u001b[C이름으로 다른 세션이 열려 있다면, 해당\u001b[C세션에서 \u001b[10;3H작업하세요. \u001b[39m                                              \u001b[11;3H                                                                \u001b[12;3H\u001b[38;5;231m- boundary-bug-hunter 에이전트 타입으로 팀원 A 를 스폰하세요. \u001b[13;3H- float-compare-bug-hunter 에이전트로 팀원 B 를 스폰하세요. \u001b[14;5Hstate-share-bug-hunter 에이전트로 팀원 C 를 스폰하세요.\u001b[39m     \u001b[15;3H                                                            \u001b[16;3H\u001b[38;5;231m각 팀원은 원인을 정확히 짚어내고 고친 코드와 이유를 보고해야 \u001b[17;3H합니다.\r\n\u001b[49m\u001b[38;5;246m  ⎿  Read \u001b[1mbuggy_app/calc.py\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[38;5;246m (19 lines)\u001b[39m\u001b[29X\r\n\u001b[38;5;246m  ⎿  Read \u001b[1mbuggy_app/test_calc.py\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[38;5;246m (26 lines)\u001b[39m\u001b[24X\u001b[20;6H\u001b[38;5;246mListed directory \u001b[1m.\u001b[Claude/agents/\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[30X\u001b[21;67H\u001b[1K\r\n\u001b[38;5;231m●\u001b[39m 현재 이 세션 자체가 \u001b[38;5;153mstate-share-bug-hunter\u001b[39m(팀원\u001b[CC)이고,\u001b[23;3H\u001b[38;5;153mboundary-bug-hunter\u001b[39m와\u001b[C\u001b[38;5;153mfloat-compare-bug-hunter\u001b[39m로\u001b[C이미\u001b[C열린\u001b[C세션이\r\n \u001b[C있으므로 그쪽에 작업을 지시하고, 저는 \u001b[38;5;153madd_record\u001b[39m의 상태\u001b[C공유\u001b[25;3H버그를 직접 분석하겠습니다.\u001b[38X\r\n\u001b[38;5;246m  ⎿  “moving_average 경계값 버그 조사 요청” → sent to \u001b[39m\u001b[13X\u001b[27;3H   \u001b[38;5;246mboundary-bug-hunter - another Claude session on this \r\n\u001b[39m     \u001b[38;5;246mmach\u001b[28;12He\u001b[39m\u001b[55X\r\n\u001b[38;5;246m  ⎿  “is_close_enough 부동소수점 비교 버그 조사 요청” → \u001b[Cent \u001b[30;6Hto float-compare-bug-hunter - another Claude session on \r\n\u001b[39m     \u001b[38;5;246mthis machine\u001b[39m\u001b[50X\u001b[32;6H\u001b[62X\r\n\u001b[38;5;246m●\u001b[C\u001b[39m\u001b[1mUpdate\u001b(B\u001b[m(buggy_app/calc.py)\u001b[40;3H"]
