;5;246m shell commands \u001b[39m\u001b[44X\u001b[21;6H\u001b[62X\r\n\u001b[38;5;231m●\u001b[C\u001b[39m2/3 통과. \u001b[38;5;153mfloat-compare-bug-hunter\u001b[39m(팀원\u001b[CB)의\u001b[C\u001b[38;5;153mis_close_enough\u001b[23;3H\u001b[39m수정만\u001b[C남았습니다\u001b[C-\u001b[C완료되면\u001b[C알려드리겠다는\u001b[C메시지를\u001b[C보냈으니\u001b[24;3H응답을 기다리겠습니다.\u001b[26;1H\u001b[38;5;246m› Message from @boundary-bug-hunter\u001b[3m: [팀원 A 완료] moving_average \r\noff-by-one 버그 고쳤습니다.\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[38;5;246m (ctrl+o to expand)\u001b[39m\u001b[21X\u001b[28;3H\u001b[65X\r\n\u001b[38;5;231m●\u001b[39m\u001b[30;67H\u001b[1K\r\n\u001b[38;5;174m✽\u001b[39m \u001b[38;5;174mPrestidigitating… \u001b[38;5;246m(45s · \u001b[38;5;248mthinking with high effort\u001b[38;5;246m)\r\n  ⎿  Tip: Use --agent <agent_name> to directly start a conversation\r\n\u001b[39m \u001b[33;6H\u001b[38;5;246mwith a subagent\u001b[35;1H\u001b[39m \u001b[C\u001b[38;5;246m› Message from @boundary-bug-hunter\u001b[3m: 전체 테스트 재실행 결과 \r\n\u001b(B\u001b[m  \u001b[38;5;246m\u001b[3m3개 모두 통과합니다 (moving_average, is_close_enough, \u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[11X\u001b[37;3H\u001b[38;5;246m\u001b[3madd_record). 팀원 B의 is_close_enough 수…\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[38;5;246m (ctrl+o to expand)\u001b[40;3H\u001b(B\u001b[m"]
