[255.763459, "o", "\u001b[2d수정만 남았습니다 - 완료되면\u001b[C알려드리겠다는\u001b[C메시지를\u001b[C보냈으니\u001b[3;3H응답을\u001b[C기다리겠습니다.\u001b[4;67H\u001b[1K\r\n\u001b[38;5;246m› Message from @boundary-bug-hunter\u001b[3m: [팀원 A 완료] moving_average \r\noff-by-one 버그 고쳤습니다.\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[38;5;246m (ctrl+o to expand)\u001b[8;1H\u001b[38;5;231m●\u001b[39m \u001b[38;5;153mboundary-bug-hunter\u001b[39m(팀원 A)로부터 \u001b[38;5;153mmoving_average\u001b[39m 수정 완료 보고를\r\n  받았습니다 - 원인(off-by-one)과 근거(테스트 통과\u001b[C확인)가\u001b[C명확해\u001b[10;3H반박할\u001b[C부분이\u001b[C없습니다.\u001b[C\u001b[38;5;153mfloat-compare-bug-hunter\u001b[39m(팀원\u001b[CB)의\u001b[C응답을\r\n \u001b[C기다리는 중입니다.\u001b[47X\r\n\u001b[38;5;246m  ⎿  “A의 moving_average 수정 확인 및 동의” → sent to \u001b[39m\u001b[13X\u001b[13;3H   \u001b[38;5;246mboundary-bug-hunter - another Claude session on this \u001b[39m\u001b[9X\u001b[14;3H   \u001b[38;5;246mmachine\u001b[39m\u001b[55X\u001b[15;67H\u001b[1K\r\n\u001b[38;5;246m› Message f\u001b[Com @boundary-bug-hunter\u001b[3m: 전체 테스트 재실행 결과 3개 \r\n모두 통과합니다 (moving_average, is_close_enough, add_record). 팀원\r\nB의 is_close_enough 수…\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[38;5;246m (ctrl+o to expand)\u001b[39m\u001b[19;67H\u001b[1K\r\n  \u001b[38;5;246mRead \u001b[1m1\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[38;5;246m file, ran \u001b[1m1\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[38;5;246m shell command \u001b[39m\u001b[32X\u001b[21;67H\u001b[1K\r\n\u001b[38;5;246m› Message from @float-compare-bug-hu…\u001b[3m: is_close_enough 버그 수정 \r\n완료했습니다 (팀원 B 작업).\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[38;5;246m (ctrl+o to expand)\u001b[25;17Hboundary-bug-hunter\u001b[3m: B의 is_clos\u001b[C_enough 도\u001b[C이미\r\n반영되어 있습니다 (return abs(a - b) <= tolerance). 제가 방금 전체 \r\n재실행했을 때 3개 테스트…\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[38;5;246m (ctrl+o to expand)\u001b[39m\u001b[28;67H\u001b[1K\r\n\u001b[38;5;231m●\u001b[39m B의 보고도 제가 직접 확인한 코드·테스트 결과와 정확히 일치합니다.\r\n  반박할 근거 부족 없음 - 세 버그 모두 확정 완료로\u001b[C처리합니다.\r\n\u001b[38;5;246m  ⎿  “B의 is_close_enough 수정 확인 및 동의” → sent to \r\n\u001b[39m \u001b[C   \u001b[38;5;246mfloat-compare-bug-hunter - another Claude session on this\u001b[39m\u001b[5X\u001b[33;3H   \u001b[38;5;246mmachine\u001b[39m\u001b[55X\u001b[40;3H"]
