[257.1844, "o", "\u001b[1;67H\u001b[1K\u001b[2;3H\u001b[65X\r\n\u001b[38;5;246m› Message from @boundary-bug-hunter\u001b[3m: [팀원 A 완료] moving_average \r\noff-by-one 버그 고쳤습니다.\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[38;5;246m (ctrl+o to expand)\u001b[39m\u001b[5;67H\u001b[1K\r\n\u001b[38;5;231m●\u001b[39m \u001b[38;5;153mboundary-bug-hunter\u001b[39m(팀원 A)로부터 \u001b[38;5;153mmoving_average\u001b[C\u001b[39m수정\u001b[C완료\u001b[C보고를\u001b[7;3H받았습니다\u001b[C-\u001b[C원인(off-by-one)과\u001b[C근거(테스트\u001b[C통과\u001b[C확인)가\u001b[C명확해\r\n \u001b[C반박할 부분이 없습니다. \u001b[38;5;153mfloat-compare-bug-hunter\u001b[39m(팀원\u001b[CB)의\u001b[C응답을\u001b[9;3H기다리는 중입니다.\u001b[47X\r\n\u001b[38;5;246m  ⎿  “A의 moving_average 수정 확인 및 동의” → sent to \u001b[39m\u001b[13X\u001b[11;3H   \u001b[38;5;246mboundary-bug-hunter - another Claude session on this \r\n\u001b[39m     \u001b[38;5;246mmachine\u001b[39m\u001b[55X\u001b[13;6H\u001b[62X\r\n\u001b[38;5;246m› Mess\u001b[Cge from @boundary-bug-hunter\u001b[3m: 전체 테스트 재실행 결과 3개 \r\n모두 통과합니다 (moving_average, is_close_enough, add_record). 팀원\r\nB의 is_close_enough 수…\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[38;5;246m (ctrl+o \u001b[Co expand)\u001b[39m\u001b[25X\u001b[17;67H\u001b[1K\r\n  \u001b[38;5;246mRead \u001b[1m1\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[38;5;246m file, ran \u001b[1m1\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[38;5;246m shell command\u001b[39m\u001b[C\u001b[32X\u001b[20;1H\u001b[38;5;246m› M\u001b[Cssage from\u001b[C@float-compare-bug-hu…\u001b[3m: is_close_enough 버그 수정 \r\n완료했습니다 (팀원 B 작업).\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[38;5;246m (ctrl+o to expand)\u001b[39m\u001b[22;67H\u001b[1K\r\n\u001b[38;5;246m› Message from @boundary-bug-hunter\u001b[3m: B의 is_close_enough 도 이미 \r\n반영되어 있습니다 (return abs(a - b) <= tolerance). 제가 방금 전체 \r\n재실행했을 때 3개 테스트…\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[38;5;246m (ctrl+o to expand)\u001b[39m\u001b[23X\u001b[26;67H\u001b[1K\r\n\u001b[38;5;231m●\u001b[39m B의 보고도 제가 직접 확인한 코드·테스트 결과와\u001b[C정확히\u001b[C일치합니다.\u001b[28;3H반박할\u001b[C근거\u001b[C부족\u001b[C없음\u001b[C-\u001b[C세\u001b[C버그\u001b[C모두\u001b[C확정\u001b[C완료로