[257.507622, "o", "\u001b[2;1H\u001b[38;5;231m●\u001b[C\u001b[39m2/3\u001b[C통과.\u001b[C\u001b[38;5;153mfloat-compare-bug-hunter\u001b[39m(팀원\u001b[CB)의\u001b[C\u001b[38;5;153mis_close_enough\r\n\u001b[39m  수정만 남았습니다 - 완료되면 알려드리겠다는 메시지를 보냈으니\u001b[4X\r\n  응답을 기다리겠습니다.\u001b[43X\u001b[6;1H\u001b[38;5;246m› Message from @boundary-bug-hunter\u001b[3m: [팀원 A 완료] moving_average \u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[1X\r\n\u001b[38;5;246m\u001b[3moff-by-one 버그 고쳤습니다.\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[38;5;246m (ctrl+o to expand)\u001b[39m\u001b[21X\u001b[8;3H\u001b[65X\r\n\u001b[38;5;231m●\u001b[C\u001b[38;5;153mboundary-bug-hunter\u001b[39m(팀원\u001b[CA)로부터\u001b[C\u001b[38;5;153mmoving_average\u001b[C\u001b[39m수정\u001b[C완료\u001b[C보고를\r\n  받았습니다 - 원인(off-by-one)과 근거(테스트 통과 확인)가\u001b[C명확해\u001b[11;3H반박할 부분이 없습니다. \u001b[38;5;153mfloat-compare-bug-hunter\u001b[39m(팀원 B)의\u001b[C응답을\u001b[12;3H기다리는 중입니다.\r\n\u001b[38;5;246m  ⎿  “A의 moving_average 수정 확인 및 동의” → sent to \r\n\u001b[39m     \u001b[38;5;246mbounda\u001b[Cy-bug-hunter - another Claude session on this \u001b[39m\u001b[9X\r\n     \u001b[38;5;246mmachine\u001b[39m\u001b[55X\u001b[16;67H\u001b[1K\r\n\u001b[38;5;246m› Message from @boundary-bug-hunter\u001b[3m: 전체 테스트 재실행 결과 3개 \r\n모두 통과합니다 (moving_average, is_close_enough, add_record). 팀원\r\nB의 is_close_enough 수…\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[38;5;246m (ctrl+o to expand)\u001b[39m\u001b[20;67H\u001b[1K\r\n  \u001b[38;5;246mRead \u001b[1m1\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[38;5;246m file, ran \u001b[1m1\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[38;5;246m shell command \u001b[39m\u001b[32X\u001b[23;17H\u001b[38;5;246mfloat-compare-bug-hu…\u001b[3m: is_close_\u001b[Cnough 버그\u001b[C수정\r\n완료했습니다 (팀원 B 작업).\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[38;5;246m (ctrl+o to expand)\u001b[39m\u001b[21X\u001b[25;67H\u001b[1K\r\n\u001b[38;5;246m› Message from @boundary-bug-hunter\u001b[3m: B의 is_close_enough 도 이미 \r\n반영되어 있습니다 (return abs(a - b) <= tolerance). 제가 방금 전체 \r\n재실행했을 때 3개 테스트…\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[38;5;246m (ctrl+o to expand)\u001b[39m\u001b[23X\u001b[29;67H\u001b[1K\r\n\u001b[38;5;231m●\u001b[C\u001b[39mB의 보고도 제가 직접 확인한 코드·테스트 결과와 정확히 일치합니다.\u001b[31;3H반박할 근거\u001b[C부족\u001b[C없음\u001b[C-\u001b[C세\u001b[C버그\u001b[C모두\u001b[C확정\u001b[C완료로\u001b[C처리합니다.\r\n\u001b[38;5;246m  ⎿  “B의 is_close_enough 수정 확인 및 동의” → sent to \r\n\u001b[39m \u001b[33;6H\u001b[38;5;246mfloat-compare-bug-hunter - another Claude session on this\u001b[34;6Hmachine\u001b[39m\u001b[35;67H\u001b[1K\r\n\u001b[38;5;231m●\u001b[39m \u001b[1m결과: 테스트 3개 모두 통과\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[39X\u001b[37;6H\u001b[62X\u001b[40;3H"]
