[280.977545, "o", "\u001b[34;3H\u001b[38;5;153m/\u001b[1mexi\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[38;5;153mt                         \u001b[1mExi\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[38;5;153mt the CLI\u001b[35;3H\u001b[38;5;246m/m\u001b[39m\u001b[1me\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[38;5;246mme\u001b[39m\u001b[1mx\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[38;5;246m-d\u001b[39m\u001b[1mi\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[38;5;246mstill                Consolidate several \u001b[39m\u001b[1mexi\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[38;5;246msting Memex notes into one durable derived note with source links. Use for \"distill my notes\", \"extract the decisions\", \"consolidate\u001b[36;3H\u001b[39m                              \u001b[38;5;246mthese not\u001b[Cs\", \"핵심만 추려서 노트로\", \"여러 노트 요약\", or \"사실만 추려줘\". Saving a single conversation output instead is memex-file, refreshing one \u001b[39m\u001b[1mexi\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[38;5;246msting…\u001b[37;5H\u001b[39m\u001b[1me\u001b[C\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[38;5;246me\u001b[37;10Hed\u001b[39m\u001b[1mi\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[38;5;246mt  \u001b[37;33HCh\u001b[Cnge\u001b[37;41Hn \u001b[39m\u001b[1mexi\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[38;5;246msting Memex note\u001b[Cin place -\u001b[Con\u001b[C heading section, one frontmat\u001b[Cer key, or a full-body rew\u001b[Cite -\u001b[Cunder a revisi\u001b[Cn\u001b[Cgua\u001b[Cd so a con\u001b[Curren\u001b[37;180Hedit is\u001b[39m\u001b[K\u001b[38;33H\u001b[38;5;246mnever clobb\u001b[Cred. Use for \"edit/update/rewrite this note\", \"fix a typo\", \"이 섹션만 고쳐줘\", \"노트 수정해줘\", \"노트 고쳐줘\", or \"메모 업데이트\". The note must \u001b[40;7H\u001b(B\u001b[m"]
